om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/snappypoly_CROOP_-_Shorter.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>3 playable characters</strong>, each with their own <strong>unique</strong> <strong>playstyle and story</strong> <strong>to experience</strong>!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/character_icons.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/line_steampage.png?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/word_gif_key_features.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Experience <strong>7 unique stages</strong>, each with their own gimmicks and bosses to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Enjoy a beautiful <strong>17-track OST</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Uncover <strong>a tragic story</strong> <strong>about acceptance</strong> through <strong>expressive characters and dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f\u00a0Record and re-watch your playthroughs with <strong>replays</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f\u00a0Hone your skills with an <strong>in-depth practice mode</strong> <i>(which hides a few secrets...)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Learn more about the bosses you've defeated in <strong>an unlockable &quot;bestiary&quot;</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f ... <strong>And more!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An easy mode, which is perfect for those new to the genre</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/line_steampage.png?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/word_gif_story.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/introCG2.1cropped-STEAM.png?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>At the edge of the earth lies a floating island inhabited by <strong>dragons</strong> called <strong>Mallow.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/mirage-STEAMt.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dragons wield <strong>incredible magic</strong>, capable of bending the universe to their will.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/priestess-STEAM.gif?t=1741160357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>But any dragon who uses their magic for evil is sealed away by <strong>a priestess</strong>...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recently, there have been rumors spreading about an evil<strong> necromancer</strong> who is planning to revive a dangerous <strong>monster</strong> at the peak of the mountain. After hearing about this, a lone priestess sets out to stop them.</p>","developers":["Amanda Konish"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it